WEBVTT

00:14:28.906 --> 00:14:30.324
It's my home.

00:14:33.368 --> 00:14:35.537
And it always will be.

00:14:38.081 --> 00:14:44.588
And now, out there in the most remote
corners of Afghanistan, are young girls,

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:46.506
dreaming to attend SOLA.

00:14:47.132 --> 00:14:48.800
My community,

00:14:48.842 --> 00:14:54.014
my students are settling
and thriving in Rwanda.

00:14:54.389 --> 00:14:56.475
And I'm so grateful we're there.

00:14:58.518 --> 00:15:02.648
I see Afghanistan now
through TV news reports